<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
SLERPTECH split-screen login brand panel.

Upstream reference: org.idempiere.zk.iceblue_c.theme (release-13 checkout,
this workspace) src/web/theme/iceblue_c/zul/login/login-left.zul, which
originally rendered <vendorLogo/><loginInfo/><versionInfo/><loginLinks/>
via macro includes into the WLogin.java west borderlayout region.

Reason for override: task 009 (split-screen login redesign) requires a
left brand marketing panel (logo, heading, feature list, decorative
shapes, footer) that has no equivalent in core Java rendering; the
west region is the only extension point WLogin.java exposes for this
kind of content, and it already auto-shows/hides based on whether this
file renders anything (see WLogin.java doCreatePart: west.setVisible(false)
only when west.getFirstChild().getFirstChild() == null).

Risk classification: LOW. This file lives entirely inside
com.slerptech.idempiere.theme (our own OSGi theme fragment), not
org.adempiere.ui.zk. No core file is modified. Content is static markup
only (no zscript logic beyond plain text), so there is no functional/
authentication behavior to regress.
-->
<zk>
<div sclass="login-brand-panel">
	<div sclass="login-brand-shape login-brand-shape-1"/>
	<div sclass="login-brand-shape login-brand-shape-2"/>
	<div sclass="login-brand-content">
		<div sclass="login-brand-logo-chip">
			<image src="~./theme/slerptech/images/login-logo.png"/>
		</div>
<html>
<![CDATA[
<h1 class="login-brand-heading">Enterprise ERP Platform</h1>
<p class="login-brand-subtext">A modern platform for managing finance, sales, purchasing, inventory, operations, and business processes in one place.</p>
<ul class="login-brand-features">
	<li><span class="login-brand-check">&#10003;</span> Financial Management</li>
	<li><span class="login-brand-check">&#10003;</span> Sales &amp; Distribution</li>
	<li><span class="login-brand-check">&#10003;</span> Purchasing</li>
	<li><span class="login-brand-check">&#10003;</span> Inventory Management</li>
	<li><span class="login-brand-check">&#10003;</span> Business Process Automation</li>
	<li><span class="login-brand-check">&#10003;</span> Secure Role-Based Access</li>
</ul>
]]>
</html>
	</div>
	<div sclass="login-brand-footer">&#169; 2026 SLERPTECH (PVT) LTD &#8226; Version 13.0</div>
</div>
</zk>

